  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: netty-codec-xml 4.1.100.Final-rhlw-00001",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released io.netty:netty-codec-xml 4.1.100.Final-rhlw-00001 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-56817 and CVE-2026-73507.\n\nCVE-2026-56817: Netty: XML External Entity (XXE) injection via unconfigured XML factory when DTD and entity processing are enabled\n\nCVE-2026-73507: Netty: Denial of Service in XmlFrameDecoder via CPU Exhaustion\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for io.netty:netty-codec-xml 4.1.100.Final from Maven Central.",
